Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That weird movement and rapid-fire\Nmagic cannon has to mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes... It takes into consideration\Nthe brain's ability from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That ship was made purely for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander! Port side Territory\Nhas reached the threshold!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Redeploy Territory!\NHurry and recharge Mistilteinn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Affirmative!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kannazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right... Mistilteinn, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That woman's got some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goetia approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Using Yggdrafolium Territory to\Nbend the trajectory... Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:00:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't let our beautiful World Tree\Nget damaged. Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of getting attacked,\NI like when you do the attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander! Goetia's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.35,0:01:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Anyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is anyone there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit, I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You came back for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By taking the life of Tohka Yatogami,\NI will regain who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An unbreakable vow of revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once again, the girl takes a step into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:52.67,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Seven:\N'The Power Given'"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at that face! That face!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So funny! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:03:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, nice job getting abducted there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, Yoshino. Now's your chance\Nto have your way with Shi--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami's dangerous! She's not normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Um, don't you think that's enough?\N--Ah, it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What gives? Complaining already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not happy to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, but... Why are you two here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I was showing Natsumi around the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We saw you and Origami together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And, well, Yoshino couldn't\Nlet it go, so we followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi! You promised not to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Anyways, this is great!\N--Did I now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Gosh, I'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Please, can you get me\Nout of these cuffs and rope?\N--Gosh, I'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:59.23,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,-Uh, sorry! Sorry about that, Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So be it. You'll have to leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.45,0:05:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, you little shits!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi? What were you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I realized, whenever I \Nremember a bad feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I somehow get back a bit of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bad feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, like during school lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had no friends, so I was eating\Nlunch alone in a bathroom stall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I completely forgot to lock the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and a girl from my class\Nfound me eating inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That would be embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And when I went back to class,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone was staring at me,\Nsnickering and laugh--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.49,0:05:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's enough! Shall we get outta here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't reach Fraxinus...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know where Tohka\Nand the others are at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, are you finally awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bastard! Why would you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't understand the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Calamities who ruin the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Beings which curse humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That alone is answer enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make me say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An... guish. Master Origami... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get your hands off of Yuzuru, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It took so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But now I've obtained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The power to kill Spirits...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The power to fulfill my wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With this strike, I'll regain who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Soon, all the Spirits will \Nbe killed by my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that never again will\Na human like me be born!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even take a step forward,\Nlet alone move an inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More... If only I had more power!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:08:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't! With that power,\NI won't be able to save anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to fight without losing who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To save Kaguya...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.25,0:08:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To help Yuzuru...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To see Miku live!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And also... for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! Lend me more power!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That form is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That hasn't changed one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But this hate and the hate of the past...\Nare somewhat different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So... I come to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you die, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.43,0:09:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're evenly matched!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With the power of this Mordred...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can face the Spirit that killed\Nmy mom and dad! And then...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Activation limit...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Evenly matched, my ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasted my whole life...\Nall spent chasing a Spirit's power...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since then, I've sacrificed \Neverything, yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I have nothing... left...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, do you wish for more power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Answer me. Do you wish for more power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Absolute power... Power enough\Nto outmatch anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... want power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what it takes.\NNo matter the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:11:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's enough power to fulfill\Nmy wish once and for all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I could have power such that\Nno one else can compare...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want power, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Substantial spirit waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a reading that wasn't in the DEM report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously? You mean another Spirit appeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's more, no spatial quake either...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A silent appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't Origami's so-called suspension\Nfixed by the DEM, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What in the world are they thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, that look...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. When I knew I had to\Nsave everyone, my power came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ques... tion. Tohka, where's Master Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I smacked her good with the flat of my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That won't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's got something called\N"Teriyaki" protecting her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Teriyaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Correction. You mean Territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We should thank her when she wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,While you were fainted,\Nshe defended you with her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. She was admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... Thank you, Miku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah. You should try\Nwaking her up then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To wake a sleeping princess,\Nyou have to give her a big wet smooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-A smooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Affirmative. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, go ahead and dive in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiss! Kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on! I didn't say nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.15,0:13:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. Me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miku! You're awake, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aww, you found me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was so close, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--You jerk! Imitating me is a grave offense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Scorn. Good grief!\N--You jerk! Imitating me is a grave offense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So sorry! Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise I'll pay you\Nboth back! With my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Confirmation. You think so, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It has to be... But, that form is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't both protect and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Prayer. Fight well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka Yatogami
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will... defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami, you little..!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bastard! Why are you a Spirit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This changes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will wield this power \Nto defeat all Spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be a Spirit-killing Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then, once I exterminate all Spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:15:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll eradicate the only one left, myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Metatron, Shemesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mal'akh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kadour!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.15,0:16:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami, I'll ask you one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we not see eye to eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My resolve will not change.\NMy mission will not change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every last Spirit I will not permit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare yourself, foolish child!\NI will punish you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard enough of your bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sandalphon, Halvanhelv!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Metatron, Artelif!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:17:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why, you two?! Why are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka! Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I did this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The me now can finally kill Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not just Tohka Yatogami either...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But even Ifrit and Nightmare, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What if doing that was possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.85,0:18:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Origami became a Spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't know all the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.23,0:18:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the time she came back, she was already...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should be resting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you really took a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sigh. Kaguya is faking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shaddap! I'm perfectly fine! Ow, ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so ugly, worthless, \Nand dirty like trash...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But trash can be recycled,\Nso I'm worse than trash...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She used a bunch of her\Npower doing first aid...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miku? Don't push yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you're worried for me, Darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, as long as I have power,\NI still have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A job?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gabriel, Requiem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to tonight's special show!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miku Izayoi, on stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wonder. My pain is fading away...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a song for pain relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not that it accomplishes much...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Miku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know! Let's get you to the hospital\Nwhile the song's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you walk, Tohka?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to seal her, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If the AST detect her,\Nthey might sound the alarm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.77,0:20:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Uh, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, right here... we have to... do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um... Well, it seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shh! Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you stop moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where'd Shido go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.86,0:21:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? Itsuka and Yatogami?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,M-Ms. Tammie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! What a hideous injury!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need the hospital, not the infirmary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go make the call!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My, my. What a strange\Ncustomer we have tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Long time no see, Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:41.44,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Eight:\N'Demon King of Descending Darkness'"
